---
---

<section class="conviction" id="about" aria-label="About $BULL">
  <div class="container conviction-inner">
    <div class="conviction-text">
      <h2 class="conviction-headline" data-reveal>THE LONG GAME</h2>

      <div class="conviction-body" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 80ms">
        <p>
          $BULL is a community token on Solana. 9.06 billion tokens in circulation,
          2,140 wallets holding. The contract is public. Anyone can verify the
          on-chain data on Birdeye.
        </p>
        <p>
          Most Solana tokens peak in week one and bleed out by week three. $BULL
          is built for the people who are still reading charts in week twelve.
          If your investment strategy outlasts the hype cycle, you know what this is.
        </p>
        <p>
          Your wallet, your conviction, your call.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="conviction-tags" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 160ms">
        <span class="tag">Community-driven</span>
        <span class="tag">On-chain</span>
        <span class="tag">Solana</span>
        <span class="tag">Long-term</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="conviction-visual" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 60ms" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="conviction-img-wrap">
        <img
          src="/heroimg.avif"
          alt=""
          class="conviction-bull"
          width="480"
          height="480"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <div class="conviction-glow"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .conviction {
    padding-block: var(--bull-space-32);
  }

  .conviction-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--bull-space-20);
  }

  .conviction-headline {
    font-family: var(--bull-font-display);
    font-size: var(--bull-text-display-md);
    color: var(--bull-ink-900);
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin-bottom: var(--bull-space-8);
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .conviction-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--bull-space-5);
    max-width: 560px;
  }

  .conviction-body p {
    font-size: var(--bull-text-body-lg);
    color: var(--bull-ink-700);
    line-height: 1.65;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .conviction-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--bull-space-2);
    margin-top: var(--bull-space-8);
  }

  .tag {
    font-size: var(--bull-text-body-sm);
    font-weight: var(--bull-fw-semibold);
    color: var(--bull-ink-700);
    border: 1px solid var(--bull-line);
    border-radius: var(--bull-radius-xs);
    padding: 6px 12px;
    transition: border-color var(--bull-duration-sm) var(--bull-ease-out-expo),
                color var(--bull-duration-sm) var(--bull-ease-out-expo);
  }

  .tag:hover {
    border-color: var(--bull-brand-600);
    color: var(--bull-brand-600);
  }

  .conviction-visual {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    position: relative;
  }

  .conviction-img-wrap {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 440px;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .conviction-bull {
    width: 85%;
    height: 85%;
    object-fit: contain;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    opacity: 0.85;
    filter: invert(1);
    will-change: filter;
  }

  .conviction-glow {
    position: absolute;
    inset: -10%;
    background: radial-gradient(
      ellipse 70% 70% at 50% 50%,
      rgba(var(--bull-brand-600-rgb), 0.08) 0%,
      transparent 70%
    );
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .conviction-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--bull-space-12);
    }

    .conviction-visual {
      order: -1;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .conviction-img-wrap {
      max-width: 260px;
      margin-inline: auto;
    }

    .conviction-body {
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
